<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 5.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 5.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 5.70 percent on Wednesday from 6.30 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said eight banks traded on the market in 20 reported transactions with a total value of 17.68 million dinars ($25.0 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
